<% layout("layout") %>

<h1>Projects</h1>
<p class="muted">Things I build and maintain.</p>

<ul class="project-list">
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://github.com/desunit/EchoPost" rel="noopener">EchoPost</a></h2>
    <p>The engine behind this site: a personal content archive that mirrors X posts to
    permanent, SEO-friendly blog pages. One Node.js process, server-rendered HTML,
    SQLite as the only datastore.
    <a href="https://github.com/desunit/EchoPost" rel="noopener">Source on GitHub</a>.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="<%= it.base %>/projects/text-watermark">Text Watermark</a></h2>
    <p>Hide an invisible watermark inside plain text using zero-width Unicode characters —
    or check suspicious text and clean the hidden characters out. Two modes:
    check&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;clean, and embed. Runs entirely in your browser; nothing is uploaded.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://github.com/desunit/appfigures-mcp" rel="noopener">Appfigures MCP</a></h2>
    <p>An MCP server that connects the Appfigures analytics API to AI assistants, so you can ask
    in plain language about app downloads, revenue, subscriptions, and reviews.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://github.com/desunit/google-play-analytics-mcp" rel="noopener">Google Play Analytics MCP</a></h2>
    <p>An MCP server that exposes Google Play Console analytics to AI agents — acquisitions by
    traffic source, installs and uninstalls, ratings, crashes, subscriptions, and reviews —
    by parsing the bulk CSV reports exported to Cloud Storage.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://github.com/desunit/reddit-ads-mcp" rel="noopener">Reddit Ads MCP</a></h2>
    <p>An MCP server that connects the Reddit Ads API to AI assistants, to browse and manage ad
    accounts, campaigns, and performance reports through natural-language commands.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://www.songtive.com/products/piano-companion" rel="noopener">Piano Companion</a></h2>
    <p>A chord and scale dictionary for piano and guitar — look up any chord or scale and build
    progressions that actually work.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://chordiq.info" rel="noopener">ChordIQ</a></h2>
    <p>Ear-training and music-theory games that build real pitch and theory skills, one quick
    session at a time.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://kidteller.com" rel="noopener">KidTeller</a></h2>
    <p>AI-generated, personalized children's books starring your own child — their name, photo,
    and favourite things, illustrated in minutes.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://mathit.app" rel="noopener">MathIt</a></h2>
    <p>A math learning app with lessons, grade-based games (K–7), and adaptive difficulty —
    plus real-time multiplayer duels for 2–5 players who share a room code and race to solve
    first.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://canmog.com" rel="noopener">CanMog</a></h2>
    <p>A can collection game for iPhone and Android: scan the barcode of any energy drink, soda,
    water or kombucha can, see how rare it is, build a shelf, and race friends up the
    leaderboard.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://ickyapp.com" rel="noopener">Icky</a></h2>
    <p>A breakup recovery app for iPhone and Android: a no-contact streak, a Panic Button for
    the urge to text, a daily mood journal, and an AI companion to talk it out.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://www.songtive.com/products/songtive" rel="noopener">Songtive</a> <span class="muted">(discontinued)</span></h2>
    <p>A social network for musicians — write, play, and share songs with chords, styles, and a
    full virtual band.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2>Rwiz AI <span class="muted">(discontinued)</span></h2>
    <p>Helped small businesses automate review responses, consolidate feedback, and build
    customer trust.</p>
  </li>
</ul>

<h2>Ventures &amp; roles</h2>
<ul class="project-list">
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://binitex.com" rel="noopener">Binitex</a> <span class="muted">— co-founder</span></h2>
    <p>A custom software development company building enterprise solutions across insurance,
    transportation, real estate, fintech, and car rental.</p>
  </li>
  <li>
    <h2><a href="https://economybookings.com" rel="noopener">EconomyBookings</a> <span class="muted">— shareholder &amp; part-time CTO</span></h2>
